     "text": "**Problem**: Let $\\phi(x, y, z) = 2x^2 + 3y^2 + 5z^2$. Find the directional derivative of $\\phi$ at the point $(1, 1, -1)$ in the direction normal to the surface of the sphere $x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 3$ at the point $(1, 1, 1)$."
