       "t": "math",
       "tex": "D_{\\hat{u}}\\phi = \\frac{4(1) + 6(1) - 10(1)}{\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{4 + 6 - 10}{\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{0}{\\sqrt{3}} = \\mathbf{0}"
