       "tex": "\\nabla f(1, 2, 1) = (2(1)(2) + 1)\\hat{i} + (1^2 + 1)\\hat{j} + (2 + 1)\\hat{k} = 5\\hat{i} + 2\\hat{j} + 3\\hat{k}"
