     "text": "**Problem**: If $\\vec{A} = xy\\hat{i} + x^2\\hat{j}$, evaluate $\\oint_C \\vec{A}\\cdot d\\vec{l} = \\oint_C (xy dx + x^2 dy)$ along the boundary of the unit square $[0, 1] \\times [0, 1]$ oriented counterclockwise."
