       "t": "math",
       "tex": "\\frac{\\partial N}{\\partial x} = 2x, \\quad \\frac{\\partial M}{\\partial y} = x \\implies \\frac{\\partial N}{\\partial x} - \\frac{\\partial M}{\\partial y} = 2x - x = x"
