      "**GATE 2020 MCQ (2M)**: Volumetric flux through concentric spherical shells.",
      "**GATE 2019 MCQ (1M)**: 2D vector coordinate rotation matrix application.",
      "**GATE 2016 NAT (2M)**: Symmetric disk integral $\\frac{5}{4}\\iint_D (x + y + 10) dx dy = 50\\pi$."
